<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine domestic oilseed/wheat industry snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine domestic oilseed/wheat industry snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimates, to July 2, of total 1996/97 purchases by Argentine oilseed crushers and wheat millers in the indicated crop year (thousands of tonnes):</p>
<p> Bread Wheat	  3,818.4</p>
<p> Maize		    979.9</p>
<p> Sorghum		   78.0</p>
<p> Soybeans	     6,006.5</p>
<p> Sunseeds	     4,481.7</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
